{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22223","headline":"登香炉峰顶 · 白居易","name":"登香炉峰顶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢迢香鑪峰，心存耳目想。\n终年牵物役，今日方一往。\n攀萝蹋危石，手足劳俛仰。\n同游三四人，两人不敢上。\n上到峰之顶，目眩神怳怳。\n高低有万寻，阔狭无数丈。\n不穷视听界，焉识宇宙广。\n江水细如绳，湓城小於掌。\n纷吾何屑屑，未能脱尘鞅。\n归去思自嗟，低头入蚁壤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}